### Goal Model Tables

| Goal ID | Goal Title                 | Text                                                                 | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1      | Deliver Resources          | Ensure all requested resources are collected and delivered to the specified location. | -                  | Achieve   | -        |
| G2      | Collect Resources          | Retrieve required resources from storage locations in an optimized order. | ;                  | Perform   | G1       |
| G3      | Deliver Resources          | Transport collected resources to the requesting agent's location.     | ;                  | Perform   | G1       |
| G2.1    | Determine Storage Order    | Calculate the optimal sequence of storages based on waiting time and path. | -                  | Query     | G2       |
| G2.2    | Visit Storage Locations    | Navigate to each storage location in the determined order.            | #                  | Perform   | G2       |
| G2.3    | Retrieve Resources         | Request and collect resources from the current storage.               | -                  | Perform   | G2       |
| G2.4    | Handle Battery Failure     | If battery drops below 10%, return to recharging station and transfer task. | FALLBACK(AT1, AT2) | Perform   | G2       |
| G3.1    | Transport Resources        | Deliver resources to the requesting agent's location in multiple runs if needed. | -                  | Perform   | G3       |
| G3.2    | Handle Delivery Battery Failure | If battery drops below 30%, return resources to a checkpoint and transfer task. | FALLBACK(AT3, AT4) | Perform   | G3       |

